		NVIDIA Jetson AGX Orin Series Board Support Package


Table of Contents
=================

1. Supported Boards
2. Change History
3. BSP Features
4. BSP Notes


1. Supported Boards
===================

This BSP supports the following boards:

   + Nvidia Jetson AGX Orin developer kit: Jetson AGX Orin 64GB module (P3701-0005) +
					   Jetson AGX Orin reference carrier board (P3737-0000)
   + Nvidia Jetson Orin Nano developer kit: Jetson Orin Nano 8GB-DRAM module (P3767-0005) +
					   Jetson Orin Nano reference carrier board (P3768-0000)


2. Change History
=================
  - 2025/09 (LINUXPG-2676): Wind River Linux 10.25 RCPL01. Standard and Preempt-rt based on
			    NVIDIA Jetpack 6.2, Jetson Linux 36.4.3 and OpenEmbedded for Tegra.
  - 2025/11 (LINUXPG-2761): Wind River Linux 10.25 RCPL03. Standard and Preempt-rt based on
			    NVIDIA Jetpack 6.2, Jetson Linux 36.4.3 and OpenEmbedded for Tegra.


3. BSP Features
===============

3.1 Supported Features
----------------------

The following BSP features are validated and supported on boards where
the corresponding h/w features exist.

  o Core
	+ CPU: Up to 12-core Arm Cortex-A78AE v8.2 64-bit CPU 3MB L2 + 6MB L3, 2.2 GHz
	+ GPU: Up to NVIDIA Ampere architecture with 2048 NVIDIA CUDA cores and 64 Tensor Cores, up to 1.3 GHz

  o Engine
	+ Deep Learning Accelerator: 2x NVDLA v2.0, up to 1.6 GHz (Only for Orin AGX)
	+ Vision Accelerator: PVA v2.0 (Only for Orin AGX)
	+ Video Encoder: H.264, H.265 (HEVC), AV1 (Only for Orin AGX)
	+ Video Decoder: H.264, H.265 (HEVC), VP8, VP9, VC1, AV1, MPEG2, MPEG4
	+ JPEG Codec: Color space conversion, Single image and batched image decoding (Only for Orin AGX)

  o Memory
	+ 64GB 256-bit LPDDR5 204.8 GB/s (Only for Orin AGX)
	+ 8GB 128-bit LPDDR5 68 GB/s or 102 GB/s (MAXN_SUPER) (Only for Orin Nano)

  o Bus
	+ 9 x I2C (Orin AGX), 4 x I2C (Orin Nano)
	+ 8 x I2S (Orin AGX), 2 x I2S (Orin Nano)
	+ 2 x CAN (Orin AGX), 1 x CAN (Orin Nano)
	+ 4 x UART (Orin AGX), 3 x UART (Orin Nano)
	+ 3 x SPI (Orin AGX), 2 x SPI (Orin Nano)
	+ 4 x USB 2.0(Orin AGX), 3x USB 2.0 (Orin Nano)
	+ 3 x USB 3.2 Gen2
	+ 1 x PCIe: Standard PCIe x16, Lower x8 used for PCIe (Upper x8 reserved) (Only for Orin AGX)
	+ 2 x SD and eMMC Controller: supporting eMMC 5.1, SD 4.0, SDHOST 4.0 and SDIO 3.0 (Orin AGX)
	+ 1 x SD and eMMC Controller: supporting eMMC 5.1, SD 4.0, SDHOST 4.0 and SDIO 3.0 (Orin Nano)
	
  o Network
	+ Ethernet: Up to 10GBASE-T (Orin AGX), up to 1000BASE-T (Orin Nano)
	+ Wireless: AW-CB375NF Dual-Band Wireless NIC
				2.4G/5GHz Dual-Band WiFi 5, RTL8822CE-CG Core
				Bluetooth 5.0, Supports BLE

  o Storage
	+ eMMC (Only for Orin AGX)
	+ NVMe card
	+ SD card
	+ USB host
	+ USB otg

  o Multimedia
	+ USB Camera
	+ CSI Camera:
		Orin AGX: 16 lanes (6, x2 or 4, x4) DPHY or CPHY
		Orin Nano: 4-lane (1, x2 or x4 and 1, x2) DPHY
	+ Display Port: Version DP v1.4a
                    Supports MST and DSC
                    Supports resolution Up to 8K60
                    Supports 16 bpp YUV422, 18 bpp RGB, 24 bpp RGB/YUV444,30 bpp RGB/YUV444 and 36 bpp RGB/YUV444 format
                    Supports 2-8 channel audio streaming up to 96 kHz sample rate
                    Supports RBR, HBR, HBR2 and HBR3 bit rates
    + High Definition Audio: Output from Display Port

  o Power Mgmt
	+ CPU hotplug
	+ CPU Frequency
	+ GPU Frequency
	+ Memory Frequency
	+ Four power modes

  o Misc Devices
    + GPIO
    + HW Watchdog
    + RTC

3.2 Unsupported Features
========================

The following features are not supported and not validated:

	x DMIC
	x DSPK


4. BSP Notes
============

4.1 Target Notes
----------------

4.1.1 Orin AGX platform
-----------------------

NOTE: This BSP is only validated in the following environment with booting from
eMMC, if used in a different environment it may run into unknown issues.

4.1.1.1 Validated Board Info
----------------------------

	Processor:		Nvidia Jetson Orin AGX
	Board:			Nvidia Jetson Orin AGX Developer kit
	BootLoader:		Jetson UEFI firmware
	BootLoader Version:	36.4.3

4.1.2 Orin Nano platform
------------------------

NOTE: This BSP is only validated in the following environment with booting from
NVMe card, if used in a different environment it may run into unknown issues.

4.1.2.1 Validated Board Info
----------------------------

	Processor:		Nvidia Jetson Orin Nano
	Board:			Nvidia Jetson Orin Nano Developer kit
	BootLoader:		Jetson UEFI firmware
	BootLoader Version:	36.4.3
